      "_comment": "Wazuh manager. protected_agents are refused by the driver at any tier and classify VIRP_TIER_BLACK at the gate hook, so the refusal files no proposal and no approval reaches it. Enforced on the endpoint bytes, NOT via the API credential's RBAC: Wazuh denies at resource level with HTTP 200 and the agent simply absent from affected_items, which is indistinguishable from the agent not existing.",
